The '''Upper Mines''' is a [[Location]] within the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} found above the {{Zone|Rampart's Quarry}} and connected to the {{Zone|Ironman's Guild}}.

== Purpose ==
The '''Upper Mines''' is serves as a place to not only go [[Mining]], but also to kill {{MobSprite|Treasure Hoarder}}s or go [[Fishing]] in the connected cave.

